From ab5a68ad408e1bd6458db2e5155d23f82bb10d70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:39:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(booking): retry zone selection on overlap so
 concurrent bookings are not rejected wrongly

When several requests pick the same free zone, only one wins the
no_overlap exclusion constraint. Losers now re-read busy zones in a new
transaction and pick another zone instead of returning 409 immediately.
Also map the block-creation race to 409 and stop treating P2002 as overlap.
